<html>
<head>
<title>Installation Notice:</title>
<hta:application
  applicationname="Popup"
  border="thick"
  borderstyle="sunken"
  caption="no"
  contextmenu="no"
  innerborder="yes"
  maximizebutton="no"
  minimizebutton="no"
  navigable="no"
  scroll="no"
  selection="no"
  showintaskbar="no"
  singleinstance="yes"
  sysmenu="no"
  windowstate="maximize"  windowstyle="0x800000"  />
<style>
  body {
    width: 300px;  height: 350px; background-color: #2b3faf;
    font-family: Times New Roman, sans-serif;
    text-align: center;
color: white;
font-size: 18px;
padding: 20px;
  }
</style>
<script language="VBScript">
  Sub Window_OnLoad
    window.resizeTo 600, 400  End Sub
</script>
</head>
<body>
  <h2><u>CarboniteDoubletakeTARGET Installation Notice!</u></h2><br>
During the installation process, you will see the installation interface. <br><br>
<u>"PLEASE DO NOT CLICK OR INTERACT WITH THE MACHINE" </u> until the application installation is completed. <br><br>
Request you to wait until the installation finishes!<br><br>
Thank You!<br>
  </body>
</html>